SUMMARY:50 Plus: Art in bark workshop
DESCRIPTION:This art form is unique to Australia and utilises the paper bar
 k shreds of melaleuca trees. Different trees produce different colours and
  are used to produce landscapes\, seascapes\, or anything your imagination
  can come up with. No paints or artificial colours are used.
LOCATION:Fifty Plus Centre\, Brisbane City
